# W8 `/allowlist` (research `appearance-security-ext.md` §`/allowlist`): the
# bare and `view` listings on an empty profile, an add to each table, every
# view, a remove, a refused reset, a refused word, and the profile after.
wait 2
type /allowlist
key Enter
wait 1
snap bare
type /allowlist view
key Enter
wait 1
snap view
type /allowlist add command "git *"
key Enter
wait 1
snap add-cmd
type /allowlist user add url https://example.com/*
key Enter
wait 1
snap user-add-url
type /allowlist view effective
key Enter
wait 1
snap view-effective
type /allowlist view local
key Enter
wait 1
snap view-local
type /allowlist view user
key Enter
wait 1
snap view-user
home files-mid
type /allowlist remove command "git *"
key Enter
wait 1
snap remove-cmd
type /allowlist local reset
key Enter
wait 1
snap local-reset
type /allowlist bogus
key Enter
wait 1
snap bogus
home files
